Nature of modification
----------------------
This is NOT a verbatim copy or redistribution of the source document. The
source is a vendor- and model-specific system prompt. This derivative extracts
only the portable operational structure from it and re-designs that structure
into a vendor-neutral agent operating skill (SKILL.md). Model identity, vendor
internals, environment-specific paths, and any unsafe or policy-bypassing
content were deliberately not carried over.

Elements extracted and redesigned from the source
--------------------------------------------------
  - tool discipline (minimal, grounded tool use; no fabricated tool output)
  - file-first behavior (read real files before acting on them)
  - artifact handling (create real files, predictable paths, verify before sharing)
  - verification and reporting (state what was changed, verified, and not verified)
  - source-grounded operation (prefer primary sources; keep attributions)
  - anti-hallucination rules (no invented files, results, line numbers, or citations)

Elements deliberately excluded from this derivative
---------------------------------------------------
  - model identity (model names, persona, self-identification)
  - vendor-specific internals (hidden tools, private APIs, internal reminders)
  - UI-specific behavior (rendering assumptions tied to a particular interface)
  - unsafe or policy-bypass behavior (anything weakening guardrails)
  - outdated platform claims (release info, product details, knowledge-cutoff dates)
  - personality imitation (tone/voice impersonation of a specific model)

